 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "54530889",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Expert Cosine Similarity Visualization — GMOE_Full on OfficeHome\n",
    "\n",
    "Reproduces the pairwise expert cosine similarity heatmap (like Figure X in the GMoE paper).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology:**\n",
    "- For each test env (0, 1, 2, 3) on OfficeHome, load the corresponding `seed0` checkpoint\n",
    "- Run inference on the **in-split of the held-out test domain** (~3000-4000 samples)\n",
    "- For each sample x, extract per-expert outputs `h_m(x) ∈ ℝ^r` for m = 1..6\n",
    "- Compute per-sample cosine similarity matrix `C(x) ∈ ℝ^{M×M}` where `C(x)_{m,n} = cos(h_m(x), h_n(x))`\n",
    "- Average `C(x)` across all samples → one M×M matrix per checkpoint\n",
    "- Average across the 4 test-env checkpoints → final heatmap\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
